From c7de4e1e8d8b74e83de322522e05b577563a764f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:28:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] emesDOS09 smart cartridge

Banked 16K ROM at $C000 (bit 7 of $FF40 selects the bank) and the SD
controller at $FF40-$FF4F, driven by the emesDOS09 PIC32 firmware's own
command code (src/emesdos09/, MIT, from CarlosCamacho/EmEsDOS09 a41c25a).
The SD card is hard disk 0 (-load-hd0), a raw FAT16 image.
